         Empirically confirmed with a throwaway Go program that
         `accrual - (-0.0)` and `accrual - (+0.0)` are bit-identical
         (printed with %b) for accrual in {0, 1500, -3.5}, including the
         accrual==0 case which yields +0 either way. The sign bit cannot
         reach CombinedCumulativeBalance.
